  "title": "I Live on the 12th Floor. Last Night My Elevator Stopped at 13.",
  "description": "Every building skips the 13th floor. Mine hid it. A night nurse on the 12th floor finds the 1974 maintenance log, a missing-nurse clipping taped inside it... and a woman in her own scrubs cooking in apartment 1307.\n\nThis is the full story behind the Short \"My building has 12 floors. The elevator stopped at 13\".\n\nWould you have stepped out? Tell me in the comments 👇\n\nCHAPTERS\n0:00 The floor that was hidden\n\nA work of fiction.\n\n#scarystories #horrorstories #3amstories #elevator #13thfloor #animatedhorror",
  "tags": [
   "scary stories",
   "horror stories",
   "13th floor",
   "elevator horror",
   "night shift horror",
   "nurse horror",
   "3am stories",
   "animated horror",
   "creepy stories",
   "scary story animated",
   "apartment horror"
  ]
 },
