  },
  {
   "scene": "bed",
   "p": {
    "time": "3:41",
    "eyes": "wide",
    "sweat": true
   },
   "text": "I didn't sleep. I sat on my bed with every light on and the chain on the door, and I told myself the obvious things.",
   "pause": 0.25
  },
  {
   "scene": "bed",
   "p": {
    "time": "4:05",
    "eyes": "tired"
   },
   "text": "I was exhausted. I'd pressed the wrong button. Someone on twelve was cooking and I got turned around. Nurses see strange things at three A.M. We're good at explaining them away.",
   "pause": 0.25
  },
  {
   "scene": "kitchen",
   "p": {
