    "lights": true,
    "snap": {
     "at": 3.6,
     "to": [
      760,
      1340
     ],
     "z": 2.2
    }
   },
   "text": "But I couldn't explain the plates. I hadn't cooked. I live alone. And one of the plates had a little lipstick on the rim. My shade.",
   "pause": 0.25
  },
  {
   "scene": "text",
   "p": {
    "text": "IT WASN'T|EVEN CLOSE.",
    "color": "#ff2a2a"
   },
   "text": "I thought that was the worst thing I'd ever see in that building. It wasn't even close.",
   "pause": 0.25
