  {
   "scene": "lobby",
   "p": {
    "manager": true
   },
   "text": "The next morning, I went straight down to the front desk.",
   "pause": 0.25
  },
  {
   "scene": "lobby",
   "p": {
    "manager": true,
    "snap": {
     "at": 3.0,
     "to": [
      860,
      760
     ],
     "z": 1.8
    }
   },
   "text": "I asked Mister Haskell if this building had a thirteenth floor. He didn't laugh. He didn't even look up. He just asked me which apartment.",
   "pause": 0.25
  },
  {
   "scene": "lobby",
   "p": {
    "manager": true,
    "mEyes": "wide",
    "thirteen": 1,
    "snap": {
     "at": 2.6,
     "to": [
      1230,
      560
     ],
     "z": 2.0
    }
   },
   "text": "I said thirteen oh seven. And for the first time in three years, he looked scared.",
   "pause": 0.25,
   "sfx": [
    [
     "sting",
     2.6
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": "lobby",
   "p": {
    "manager": true,
    "mEyes": "tired"
   },
   "text": "He said the elevator was installed the year the building opened. He said it had always been, his word, particular. And he said the thirteenth floor wasn't removed because of superstition.",
   "pause": 0.25
  },
  {
   "scene": "lobby",
   "p": {
    "manager": true,
    "mEyes": "wide",
    "push": 0.04
   },
   "text": "It was removed because people kept getting off there.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "sfx": [
    [
     "sting",
     1.6
    ]
   ]
  },
