    "label": "Floor 13 - night 2",
    "rec": false,
    "spike": 0.1
   },
   "text": "Then I remembered my phone. The camera had been running the whole time.",
   "pause": 0.25
  },
  {
   "scene": "memo",
   "p": {
    "clock": "03:05:20",
    "label": "Floor 13 - night 2",
    "rec": false,
    "spike": 0.3
   },
   "text": "The video shows the elevator doors opening. It shows the dark hallway. It shows her, at the end, with her back to me.",
