    "manager": true,
    "mEyes": "tired"
   },
   "text": "I showed Mister Haskell the note. He read it twice. Then he told me the rest.",
   "pause": 0.25
  },
  {
   "scene": "lobby",
   "p": {
    "manager": true
   },
   "text": "Ruth wasn't the first. She was the second nurse from twelve oh seven to go missing.",
